Package: rdocmetrics
Title: Behavioral Measures for the RDoC Task Battery
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Margot", "Mitchell", email = "marg0tm@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The behavioral measures of the RDoC task battery, as the
    study reports them: accuracy, reaction time and omissions per condition,
    contrasts between conditions, post-error slowing, the congruency sequence
    effect, post-stop slowing, stop-signal reaction time and span recall.
    Each function takes one task's trial table and returns one row per
    subject and session, with times in milliseconds.
